            # leaves sc_num == -1 and would otherwise fall through to the
            # `0F 05` Linux syscall below — a silent no-op / fault on
            # Windows. Emit a runtime switch over the routable syscalls of
            # this arity instead. v6.1.17: an arity with NO routable syscall
            # (EPE_SYSCALL_DYNAMIC → 2) no longer hard-errors — that blocked the
            # whole PE tarball build for a call almost always on a Linux-only
            # path dead on Windows (e.g. `syscall(SYS_GETDENTS64, fd, buf, 4096,
